OL,3,GNEWSABog snorkelling among man's 365
OL,4,Asports challenge
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who set himself the challenge of
OL,7,Fcompleting 365 sports in 365 days,
OL,8,Fincluding bog snorkelling and gravy
OL,9,Fwrestling, says he is overwhelmed with
OL,10,Fthe support he has received.
OL,12,FJacob Vahey, 25, from North Ferriby,
OL,13,FEast Yorkshire, started the challenge
OL,14,Fon 1 October 2025 to raise money for
OL,15,Fthe Campaign Against Living Miserably
OL,16,F(CALM) - and has since taken part in
OL,17,Fabout 300 sports.
OL,19,FHe said although he is slightly behind,
OL,20,Fhe still hoped to try 365 sports by the
OL,21,Fend of 2026, or the beginning of 2027.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
