OL,3,GNEWSABog snorkelling among man's 365
OL,4,Asports challenge
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said: "It's been absolute chaos
OL,7,Ftrying to plan the different sports and
OL,8,Fmake sure everything is in place. But
OL,9,FI've enjoyed every bit of it, it's been
OL,10,Fa very enjoyable chaos."
